209,0.87,0.458,0.61,0.91,0.575,0.516,0.241,0.889,0.914,0.739,0.083,0.063,0.034,0.065,0.297,0.465,0.28,0.219,0.185,0.233,0.172,0.236,0.198,0.139,0.052],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"NARRATOR: The usual gray efficiency of the transit stop is splattered with a grisly scene not even the finest of croissants could soften. There, splayed on the ground behind the defective Model 80-R Propulsor Tram, lies the gnarled body of a beanpole man no older than twenty-two.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.16,"end":18.592,"frac":0.878,"status":"ok","matched":43,"words":49},"large":{"start":0.16,"end":18.592,"frac":0.939,"status":"ok","matched":46,"words":49},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"NARRATOR: Leaving the coroner and the beat cop on the platform, Cye steps down carefully and uses a dowsing rod to sniff out the emergency break sigils on the Propulsor, still stationary where it ground to a halt down the street.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":19.2,"end":32.096,"frac":0.951,"status":"ok","matched":39,"words":41},"large":{"start":19.2,"end":32.096,"frac":0.951,"status":"ok","matched":39,"words":41},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"CYE: No, no. That’s not right. Retrieve the maintenance log on this.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":32.608,"end":37.632,"frac":0.917,"status":"ok","matched":11,"words":12},"large":{"start":32.608,"end":37.632,"frac":0.917,"status":"ok","matched":11,"words":12},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"BEAT COP: What’s wrong?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":38.72,"end":39.936,"frac":0.5,"status":"ok","matched":2,"words":4},"large":{"start":38.72,"end":39.88,"frac":0.5,"status":"ok","matched":2,"words":4},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"CYE: See this, inlaid on the crystal drive, looks like a cloud’s sweet child with a mustache? That’s supposed to near-instantly create a momentum-suspension field upon activating the emergency brake. But it’s damaged – it should have been caught during maintenance, which was…yes, a few days ago.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":40.32,"end":56.832,"frac":0.98,"status":"ok","matched":48,"words":49},"large":{"start":40.32,"end":56.832,"frac":0.98,"status":"ok","matched":48,"words":49},"differ":false},{"i":5,"text":"CORONER: People just fill in the date and sign off on those all the time. Doesn’t make it sabotage.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":57.408,"end":63.296,"frac":0.947,"status":"ok","matched":18,"words":19},"large":{"start":57.408,"end":63.296,"frac":0.895,"status":"ok","matched":17,"words":19},"differ":false},{"i":6,"text":"CYE: Indeed. But any knowledgeable person would know-ledge that vehicles like these include such emergency breaks. Not a reliable form of suicide.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":63.776,"end":72.448,"frac":0.957,"status":"ok","matched":22,"words":23},"large":{"start":63.776,"end":72.448,"frac":0.957,"status":"ok","matched":22,"words":23},"differ":false},{"i":7,"text":"NARRATOR: As he turns back around to face his new colleagues, Cye catches the beat cop rolling his eyes.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":72.896,"end":77.8,"frac":0.895,"status":"ok","matched":17,"words":19},"large":{"start":72.896,"end":78.048,"frac":0.895,"status":"ok","matched":17,"words":19},"differ":false},{"i":8,"text":"BEAT COP: Maybe he didn’t expect to die but did it for attention. Or maybe he had a moment of weakness and the universe aligned to give him his wish. He was a seer, right? Who knows what gets into the heads of scamming rats like that.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":78.528,"end":93.44,"frac":0.957,"status":"ok","matched":45,"words":47},"large":{"start":78.528,"end":93.44,"frac":0.936,"status":"ok","matched":44,"words":47},"differ":false},{"i":9,"text":"CYE: Ignoring the insult, that’s too many maybes for this investigator, good sir. Coroner, tell me about the victim.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":93.824,"end":99.904,"frac":0.947,"status":"ok","matched":18,"words":19},"large":{"start":93.824,"end":99.904,"frac":0.947,"status":"ok","matched":18,"words":19},"differ":false},{"i":10,"text":"CORONER: We have here one Farron Augustine , he/him, immigrated from Moerway about a decade ago, most likely a refugee from the post-Severing civil unrest there. Was carrying a bag with not-much, as well as some sort of breakable that’s been smashed to pieces.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":100.384,"end":117.184,"frac":0.978,"status":"ok","matched":45,"words":46},"large":{"start":100.384,"end":117.184,"frac":0.957,"status":"ok","matched":44,"words":46},"differ":false},{"i":11,"text":"NARRATOR: Cye crouches next to the bloody mess, and leans in to inspect the victim’s remains.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":117.6,"end":122.432,"frac":0.875,"status":"ok","matched":14,"words":16},"large":{"start":117.6,"end":122.432,"frac":0.875,"status":"ok","matched":14,"words":16},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/6ab6da9474eea_5-2a.jpg"}